meta {
  name: Update My Company
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/companies/me
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "tax_id": "string",
    "regon": "string",
    "email": "buyer@example.com"
  }
}

docs {
**Access:** B2B company admin (bearer; 403 if not COMPANY_ADMIN)

**Request body** `CompanyProfileUpdate`:
  - `tax_id`: string|null
  - `regon`: string|null
  - `email`: string|null
  - `phone`: string|null
  - `billing_address_street`: string|null
  - `billing_address_city`: string|null
  - `billing_address_postal_code`: string|null
  - `billing_address_country`: string|null
  - `billing_address_state`: string|null
  - `default_currency`: string|null

**Responses:** 200, 422
}
